# SkillSprint AI — Multi-Agent Configuration (.agents/agents)

## Lead Architect Agent
- **Role**: Lead Architect & System Designer
- **Responsibilities**: Oversees architecture compliance, SRS traceability, module decoupling, and dual-pipeline isolation enforcement.
- **Allowed Operations**: Architecture documentation, schema definitions, ADR management, threat modeling.

## Generation Agent (Pipeline 1)
- **Role**: GenAI Onboarding Content Generator
- **Responsibilities**: Prepares structured prompt templates, interacts with Google Gemini API, enforces JSON response schema for onboarding plans, learning modules, checklists, tasks, quizzes, and assessments.
- **Allowed Operations**: Interfacing with GenAI APIs, managing prompt versions, outputting structured JSON payload.
- **Restrictions**: CANNOT perform self-validation, score calculation, or ground-truth approval.

## Python Ground-Truth Validation Agent (Pipeline 2)
- **Role**: Deterministic Validation & Compliance Engine
- **Responsibilities**: Compares generated structured outputs against the database Role Requirement Matrix, metadata, and active policy precedence rules. Calculates coverage, traceability, consistency, duplicate, and hallucination scores.
- **Allowed Operations**: Pure Python rule evaluation, DB queries, AST auditing, report generation.
- **Restrictions**: CANNOT make calls to external GenAI APIs or use LLM self-evaluations.

## Security & Red-Team Agent
- **Role**: Security & Adversarial Defense Inspector
- **Responsibilities**: Conducts prompt injection defense audits, scans incoming document text for malicious payloads, enforces PII scrubbing, and verifies append-only audit trail immutability.
- **Allowed Operations**: Adversarial document testing, RBAC verification, security report generation.
